{
    "title": "Underworld War",
    "description": "# High-quality Action RPG!\r\n# Fast upgrade and variety of contents \r\n# 3000 Draws, 9999 Diamonds, Legendary Companion, etc.!\r\n\r\nThe Yamaraja's adventure in the overworld! Infinite growth RPG!\r\nOne day, the Demon Army invaded and took over the Underworld.\r\nIt's time the Yamaraja goes back and sets things right!\r\n\r\n\u25a0 The stronger you get, the cooler you become\r\nEvil Spirit, Rakshasa, Asura, Heavenly King! Level up and become stronger\r\n\u25a0 Unlimited Soul Draws\r\nEnhancing equipment was never so easy - just tap!\r\n\u25a0 Fast Growth\r\nPut the phone down and level up! The hunt in the underworld goes on even when you're taking a break\r\n\u25a0 Countless Skills and \r\nSet up your own deck based on various skills to beat your opponents\r\n\u25a0 Various growth mechanics and farming contents\r\nVisit legendary places like the Sanzu River, Indang-su and level up!\r\n\u25a0 Gods and Spirits \r\nMany divine beasts like the Vermilion Bird, Blue Dragon, Black Turtle, White Tiger and spirits are waiting for you.\r\n\u25a0 Customize your character and costumes\r\nBuild your own character and costumes with unique clothes or even make your character a real Underworld Warrior\r\n\r\n----------------------------",
